<h3>Carcases and interiors</h3>
<p>Standard for our Pronorm orders: <strong>stratus grey pearl (3160)</strong> carcases, <strong>proTech X</strong> drawer system in anthracite, push-to-open glass cases, full-extension soft-close everywhere. The Pronorm interior fit-out — knife blocks, spice trays, kitchen roll holders, drawer dividers — is built into this spec the way it should be: invisible until you pull a drawer.</p>

